Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P0RK965</idno><idno type="APIS">7396</idno></person></listPerson><listBibl><bibl xml:id="work3746"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mahāyānasūtrālaṃkāra</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mahāyānasūtrālaṃkārakārikā</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po mdo sde'i rgyan zhes bya ba'i tshig le'ur byas pa</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mdo sde rgyan</title><author ref="person:3747">maitreya</author><author ref="person:3756">asaṅga</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">3746</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5038"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sems bskyed sdom pa rang gi blang ba'i cho ga</title><title xml:lang="bo">སེམས་བསྐྱེད་སྡོམ་པ་རང་གི་བླང་བའི་ཆོ་ག</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">5038</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5040"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sems tsam lugs kyi smon 'jug gi sems bskyed kyi cho ga</title><title xml:lang="bo">སེམས་ཙམ་ལུགས་ཀྱི་སྨོན་འཇུག་གི་སེམས་བསྐྱེད་ཀྱི་ཆོ་ག</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po'i sems bskyed pa'i cho ga sems tsam lugs byon</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">5040</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5042"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">smon 'jug sems bskyed kyi cho ga</title><title xml:lang="bo">སྨོན་འཇུག་སེམས་བསྐྱེད་ཀྱི་ཆོ་ག</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">smon 'jug gi sems skyed kyi cho ga byed tshul</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Compilation of three texts: (1) slob dpon chen po zhi ba lha'i lugs kyi smon 'jug gi sems kyi cho ga; (2) smon 'jug sems bskyed kyi rgyud pa'i bla ma rnams la bstod pa; (3) dbu ba lugs su grags pa'i sems bskyed brgyud pa la phyag 'tshal ba.</note><idno type="APIS">5042</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5045"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">blo sbyong brgyud pa'i gsol 'debs</title><title xml:lang="bo">བློ་སྦྱོང་བརྒྱུད་པའི་གསོལ་འདེབས</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">blo sbyong don bdun ma'i khrid yig</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">blo sbyong don bdun ma brgyud pa'i gsol 'debs dang bcas pa</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">In instance (ID:5044), the prayer precedes the work on mind training (see work (ID:5049)). In instance (ID:5048), it follows that work, but only the beginning of the prayer is extant as the manuscript is incomplete.</note><idno type="APIS">5045</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5047"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">thogs med bzang po dpal gyi bka' 'bum 'thor bu'i skor</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཐོགས་མེད་བཟང་པོ་དཔལ་གྱི་བཀའ་འབུམ་འཐོར་བུའི་སྐོར</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgyal sras thogs med pa'i bka' 'bum thor bu</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Contains several short compositions, each with an individual colophon naming the author and place of composition, and for some the addressee or requester.</note><idno type="APIS">5047</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5049"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">blo sbyong don bdun ma'i snyan brgyud kyi tshig rnams yi ge nyung ngu'i sgo nas bkrol ba</title><title xml:lang="bo">བློ་སྦྱོང་དོན་བདུན་མའི་སྙན་བརྒྱུད་ཀྱི་ཚིག་རྣམས་ཡི་གེ་ཉུང་ངུའི་སྒོ་ནས་བཀྲོལ་བ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">blo sbyong don bdun ma</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01">after 1305</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">In instance (ID:5044), the work is preceded to a prayer to the members of the lineage, see work (ID:5045). In instance (ID:5048), the work is followed by the start of that prayer, but the manuscript is incomplete.&#13;
In the closing verses, the author mentions "grags pa" (ID:7022), i.e., mKhan chen bSod nams grags according to a gloss in instance (ID:5044), as his teacher. This could be Rin chen bSod nams grags pa or Byang sems bSod nams grags pa.&#13;
In instance (ID:5044), the main text alternates with glosses, and the author of the glosses added two lines after the colophon, mentioning having studied mind training for three years.</note><idno type="APIS">5049</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5051"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rten 'brel snying po'i khrid yig</title><title xml:lang="bo">རྟེན་འབྲེལ་སྙིང་པོའི་ཁྲིད་ཡིག</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">5051</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5055"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po'i blo sbyong</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཐེག་པ་ཆེན་པོའི་བློ་སྦྱོང</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po'i blo sbyong rgyal sras thogs med pa'i gsung sgros dang bcas pa</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">5055</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5057"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgyas sras zhi ba lha'i gsung sgros</title><title xml:lang="bo">རྒྱས་སྲས་ཞི་བ་ལྷའི་གསུང་སྒྲོས</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">5057</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5061"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">phyag chen lhan cig skyes sbyor gyi khrid yig</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཕྱག་ཆེན་ལྷན་ཅིག་སྐྱེས་སྦྱོར་གྱི་ཁྲིད་ཡིག</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">5061</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5063"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sangs rgyas byang sems la bstod pa dang sman bla'i rjes gnang</title><title xml:lang="bo">སངས་རྒྱས་བྱང་སེམས་ལ་བསྟོད་པ་དང་སྨན་བླའི་རྗེས་གནང</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">5063</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5065"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bla ma la bstod dang ba'i chu rgyun</title><title xml:lang="bo">བླ་མ་ལ་བསྟོད་དང་བའི་ཆུ་རྒྱུན</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">5065</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5068"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">jo bo rin po che'i bstod pa la sogs pa yi dam gyi lha 'ga' zhig gi bstod pa</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཇོ་བོ་རིན་པོ་ཆེའི་བསྟོད་པ་ལ་སོགས་པ་ཡི་དམ་གྱི་ལྷ་འགའ་ཞིག་གི་བསྟོད་པ</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Instance (ID:5068) contains several eulogies/prayers, (i) f. 1b-2a7 "'jam pa'i dbyangs la bston pa", requested by yang dag pa'i dge ba'i bshes gnyen dpal ldan ye shes, composed by btsun pa thogs med. (ii) 2a7-3b3 "'phags pa spyan ras gzigs dbang phyug la bston pa'i tshigs su bcad pa phan bde'i 'byung gnas", composed by ma Ni pa thogs med in dNgul chu'i chos rdzong. (iii) 3b3-5a4 "spyan ras gzigs la bstod pa tshig rgyan me tog phreng ba", composed by chos smra ba'i btun pa thog pa med; (iv) 5a4-6a3 ?; (v) 6a3-7a1 "bsnyen rdzogs kyi mkhan rgyud la bston pa", requested by slob dpon byams chos pa byang chub rgyal mtshan, composed by chos smra ba'i btun pa thogs med in dNgul chu'i chos rdzong, scribe was 'byam (sic) dbyangs dkar po ; (vi) 7a1-7b8, composed by thogs med for the "jo bo bskor ba rnams".</note><idno type="APIS">5068</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5071"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">ldong ston la gdams pa sogs springs yig gi skor</title><title xml:lang="bo">ལྡོང་སྟོན་ལ་གདམས་པ་སོགས་སྤྲིངས་ཡིག་གི་སྐོར</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">5071</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5073"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bsngo ba'i rim pa</title><title xml:lang="bo">བསྔོ་བའི་རིམ་པ</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">5073</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5075"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po rgyud bla ma'i 'grel pa nges don gsal ba'i 'od zer</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཐེག་པ་ཆེན་པོ་རྒྱུད་བླ་མའི་འགྲེལ་པ་ངེས་དོན་གསལ་བའི་འོད་ཟེར</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po rgyud bla ma'i 'grel ba nges don gsal bar byed pa'i 'od zer</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">5075</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5077"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po mdo sde rgyan gyi 'grel pa rin po che'i phreng ba</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཐེག་པ་ཆེན་པོ་མདོ་སྡེ་རྒྱན་གྱི་འགྲེལ་པ་རིན་པོ་ཆེའི་ཕྲེང་བ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po mdo sde rgyan gyi 'grel pa rin pa rin po che'i phreng ba</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">This work might correspond to the "rnam bshad" listed in A khu ching Shes rab rgya mtsho's Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 528, No. 1148574: rgyal sras thogs med bzang po'i mdo sde rgyan gyi rnam bshad).</note><relatedItem type="commentaryOn" target="work:3746"/><idno type="APIS">5077</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5139"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">byang chub sems dpa'i spyod pa la 'jug pa'i 'grel pa legs par bshad pa rgya mtsho</title><title xml:lang="bo">བྱང་ཆུབ་སེམས་དཔའི་སྤྱོད་པ་ལ་འཇུག་པའི་འགྲེལ་པ་ལེགས་པར་བཤད་པ་རྒྱ་མཚོ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">spyod 'jug 'grel pa legs bshad rgya mtsho</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1364-01-01" notAfter="1364-12-31">1364</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Date of composition: shing pho 'brugi lo snron gyi zla ba = 1364.&#13;
&#13;
A "spyod 'jug 'grel pa" is  listed by A khu ching shes rab rgya mtsho in his Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 514, No. 11080: rgyal sras thogs med pa'i spyod 'jug 'grel pa legs par bshad pa'i rgya mtsho).</note><idno type="APIS">5139</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5141"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">grub mtha' rgya mtsho'i rgyan</title><title xml:lang="bo">གྲུབ་མཐའ་རྒྱ་མཚོའི་རྒྱན</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">grub mtha' rgya mtsho'i rgyan</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1304-01-01" notAfter="1364-12-31">after 1304 before 1364</date><author ref="person:5951">'phags pa</author><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Date of composition: shing pho 'grug gi lo snron gyi zla ba (the fifth month of the male wood dragon year), i.e., 1304 or 1364 (or later), as the author refutes dBus pa blo gsal (ID:4091) (1270-1355).&#13;
The work deals with non-Buddhist and Buddhist tenets, for the latter the three, bye brag tu smra ba, mdo sde pa, rnam rig sems tsam pa, and finally Madhyamaka.</note><idno type="APIS">5141</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work7025"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sems sdom pa'i brgyud pa'i bla ma rnams la phyag 'tshal ba</title><title xml:lang="bo">སེམས་སྡོམ་པའི་བརྒྱུད་པའི་བླ་མ་རྣམས་ལ་ཕྱག་འཚལ་བ</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1305-01-01" notAfter="1369-12-31">after 1305 before 1369</date><author ref="person:4066">rgyal sras thogs med bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">7025</idno></bibl></listBibl><listPlace><place xml:id="place4352"><placeName xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bo dong e</placeName><placeName xml:lang="bo">བོ་དོང་ཨེ</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">bo dong e dgon pa</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">dpal e'i gtsug lag khang</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">dpal e'i chos gra chen po</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">dpal ldan e shod</placeName><location><geo>29.30021516982113 88.20003217967547</geo></location><idno type="APIS">4352</idno></place><place xml:id="place5692"><placeName xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dngul chu'i chos rdzong</placeName><placeName xml:lang="bo">དངུལ་ཆུའི་ཆོས་རྫོང</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">chos rdzong</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">dngul chu chos rdzong</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">dngul chu ri khrod</placeName><location><geo>29.399722 88.233056</geo></location><idno type="APIS">5692</idno></place></listPlace><listRelation><relation xml:id="rel7813" name="quotes-with-name" active="#person4066" passive="#person4243" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel4714" name="requests" active="#person5066" passive="#person4066" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel4691" name="requests" active="#person7021" passive="#person4066" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="re